//! id:        gen_credence_unbounded_param_reject
//! section:   20_generics
//! expect:    reject
//! error:     TypeError
//! spec:      v1.1.0 design 5.1, 3 (Credence<E> requires E be an enum; an unbounded param cannot satisfy it)
